AltoRewardsOracle::Constructor()
├── given invalid inputs
│   ├── when uniswap node is invalid
│   │   └── it should revert with ModuleUniswapInvalidInput
│   ├── when inToken is not Alto token
│   │   ├── when direction is IN_TO_OUT
│   │   │   └── it should revert with AltoRewardsOracleInvalidInput
│   │   └── when direction is OUT_TO_IN
│   │       └── it should revert with AltoRewardsOracleInvalidInput
│   ├── when chainlink node is invalid
│   │   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidInput
│   ├── when owner is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
│   ├── when priceUpdateCooldownPeriod is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoRewardsOracleInvalidInput
└── given valid inputs
    ├── when valid parameters provided
    │   ├── it should set inTokenOneUnit correctly
    │   ├── it should set priceUpdateCooldownPeriod correctly
    │   ├── it should set owner correctly
    │   ├── it should set uniswap node correctly
    │   ├── it should set chainlink node correctly
    │   ├── it should initialize lastPriceUpdateTimestamp to zero
    │   └── it should initialize cachedPrice to zero